        {
          "id": "ddee9d29-eac6-41d8-aa01-a70646550e92",
          "name": "Basic Shorts Anthracite",
          "description": "<p>Elevate your casual wardrobe with the Basic Shorts in Anthracite, expertly crafted by Nuvora. These shorts are designed with a lightweight build, ensuring optimal comfort and breathability, making them an ideal choice for warm weather and active lifestyles.</p>\n<br>\n<h3>Premium Fabric Composition</h3>\n<p>Constructed from a high-quality cotton-blend fabric, these shorts offer a soft touch against the skin while maintaining durability. The blend enhances moisture-wicking properties, allowing for effective temperature regulation during physical activities. This feature is particularly beneficial for those who engage in outdoor sports or leisurely strolls.</p>\n<br>\n<h3>Versatile Design</h3>\n<p>The Basic Shorts are designed for effortless pairing with a variety of tops, from casual tees to stylish button-ups. Their neutral anthracite color provides a sophisticated backdrop that complements any outfit, making them suitable for both relaxed weekends and casual outings.</p>\n<br>\n<h3>Tailored Fit Options</h3>\n<p>Available in sizes S, M, L, and XL, these shorts cater to a diverse range of body types, ensuring a comfortable and flattering fit for all. The tailored design not only enhances the silhouette but also allows for ease of movement, making them perfect for both lounging and active pursuits.</p>\n<br>\n<h3>Functional Features</h3>\n<p>Incorporating practical elements, these shorts are equipped with pockets that provide convenient storage for essentials such as keys, wallets, or mobile devices. The thoughtful design ensures that functionality does not compromise style, making them a reliable choice for everyday wear.</p>\n",
